39	/// For each entry:
40	///
41	/// 1. Parse the key.
42	/// 2. `name@<exact-semver>` → `group.exact[version]`.
43	/// 3. `name@<range>` with `range.trim() == "*"` → `group.all`.
44	/// 4. `name@<range>` otherwise → push onto `group.range`.
45	/// 5. Bare `name` (or unparsable key) → `group.all`.
46	///
47	/// Rule 2/3/4 order mirrors upstream. Note rule 5's wildcard wins
48	/// over a later explicit `name@*`: upstream uses the bare-name branch
